{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/767266-exalted-3e-interest-check","id":767266,"title":"Exalted 3e Interest Check","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-11-16T13:21:44-08:00","id":767266,"title":"Exalted 3e Interest Check","content":"I'm intending to devote a little more time to gaming in the face of the new edition of Exalted.<br /> <br /> For interested parties, I plan to start <b>two</b> new games. I've already got some players lined up, so <b>I only intend to pick up two or three new players here</b>.<br /> <br /> <b>Game 1: Expedition to Rathess</b><br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><b>Player Count:</b> Seeking 1-2 players, for a total of 3-4 players.<br /> <b>Style of Play:</b> Keep it relatively simple; I'm new to this edition and haven't fully absorbed all the rules yet.<br /> <b>Allowed Content:</b> Ex3 core<br /> <b>Character Creation:</b><ul><li>Backstory: A Dragon-Blooded Dynast is making the long, difficult journey to the ancient Eastern city of Rathess seeking a long-lost wonder. You are part of her <b>mortal</b> entourage: an advisor, a bodyguard, a cook, a driver, an expert, a guide, an Immaculate monk, a medic, a musician, a slave; she has seen fit to bring you along on this journey.</li> <li>Experience: 0. You're starting characters.</li> <li>Resources: If it makes sense for you to take the Resources background (a skilled medic or a valued bodyguard), take it. If it doesn't (slave), don't take it.</li> </ul><b>Other Notes:</b> As a reminder, this is a <b>mortal</b> game. This one will be played on Skype, most likely on Sundays or Mondays.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <b>Game 2</b><br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><b>System:</b> Exalted Third Edition<br /> <b>Player Count:</b> Seeking 1-2 players, for a total of 3-4 players.<br /> <b>Style of Play:</b> Keep it relatively simple; I'm new to this edition and haven't fully absorbed all the rules yet.<br /> <b>Allowed Content:</b> Ex3 core<br /> <b>Other Notes:</b> More details will come as I speak with the other players to see what they want to do; currently the only solid detail so far is an interest in the Dreaming Sea. This one will be played either on <a href=\"http://www.giantitp.com/forums\" target=\"_blank\">GitP</a>, or here on the Onyx Path Forums. At the moment, this is merely an interest check.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":177,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","user":"TheCountAlucard","date":". 11-18-2015, 08:17 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-17T06:06:35-08:00","id":767778,"title":"","content":"Got two people here. (Me and a buddy of mine) Very consistent with weekend attendance with my own games I run and looking for something to play more during the week. We haven't played any version of exalted before but I've been researching it in prep for 3rd edition and it sounds pretty awesome. About the only day I wouldn't be able to play is on Saturday. What time would you be looking to play on mondays?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9236-yig1015w","name":"Yig1015w","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"182"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-17T20:13:16-08:00","id":768253,"title":"","content":"I wouldn't mind joining too. At least if its PbP. I don't have Skype.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://youtu.be/_yBS2EZFduI?t=2m13s\" target=\"_blank\">Homo sapiens. What an inventive, invincible species. It's only a few million years since they crawled up out of the mud and learned to walk. Puny, defenceless bipeds. They've survived flood, famine and plague. They've survived cosmic wars and holocausts. And now, here they are, out among the stars, waiting to begin a new life. Ready to outsit eternity. They're indomitable. Indomitable.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/420-akatsukileader13","name":"AkatsukiLeader13","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar420_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1637"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-18T05:15:47-08:00","id":768425,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Yig1015w</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/767266-exalted-3e-interest-check?p=767778#post767778\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Got two people here. (Me and a buddy of mine) Very consistent with weekend attendance with my own games I run and looking for something to play more during the week. We haven't played any version of exalted before but I've been researching it in prep for 3rd edition and it sounds pretty awesome. About the only day I wouldn't be able to play is on Saturday. What time would you be looking to play on mondays?</div> </div> </div> </div>One of my other players is, I'm told, in school, so Sunday would probably be preferred to Monday.<br /> <br /> Do you have a copy of the rules yet?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-18T17:16:24-08:00","id":768804,"title":"","content":"Monday would be far better for us in all honestly and unfortunately I did not know about Scion when it was able to be backed. A complete noobie in the setting other than reading blogs about the 3rd edition. Dunno how difficult of a game it would be to play without our own copy of the rules. If it it would be a pain, don't worry about it and grab the next people that can play without issue. I'd just patiently wait for the public release and run my own game eventually.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9236-yig1015w","name":"Yig1015w","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"182"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-02T23:12:38-08:00","id":778826,"title":"","content":"I would be down for the PbP style one.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"